{"seq":59,"slug":"game-tutorial-onboarding","title":"教程与新手引导","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tutorial-onboarding","rating":{"composite":4.02,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"教程与新手引导\">教程与新手引导</h1><p>一款游戏在玩家按下&quot;开始&quot;后的头几分钟里，要同时完成两件几乎矛盾的事：把一套陌生的规则、操作和目标塞进玩家脑子里，又不能让他觉得自己在上课。这就是新手引导（onboarding）要解决的问题。它不是游戏的附属品，而是决定一款游戏能不能把&quot;下载量&quot;转化成&quot;留存&quot;的第一道闸门——2026 年的移动游戏数据里，次日留存（D1）的中位数只有约 22%，而第七日留存（D7）中位数已经跌到 4% 左右，绝大多数流失发生在玩家还没真正理解这款游戏之前。</p>\n<p>本 hub 把&quot;教程与新手引导&quot;当成一门可以拆解、可以度量、可以迭代的工程学科来讲，而不是一组零散的设计技巧。全 hub 围绕四条主线递进：</p>\n<p>第一条线是<strong>基础</strong>：先回答&quot;为什么必须认真做引导&quot;，再用心流理论与学习曲线解释玩家在头几分钟里的心理状态，最后给出一张&quot;教学手段谱&quot;，把后面所有具体技巧放进同一个坐标系。这一章是认知地基，后三章都建立在它之上。</p>\n<p>第二条线是<strong>手段</strong>：聚焦&quot;怎么教&quot;。情境化教学讲在玩法发生的那一刻就地教学；引导与发现讲在&quot;手把手&quot;和&quot;放手让玩家自己摸索&quot;之间如何取舍；提示与遮罩则把镜头拉近到具体的 UI 表层——气泡、高亮、遮罩、幽灵手势这些日常工具。</p>\n<p>第三条线是<strong>结构</strong>：聚焦&quot;按什么顺序教、教多少&quot;。节奏与解锁讲如何用功能门控把信息细水长流地喂给玩家；渐进复杂度讲如何把复杂系统拆成一次只教一个的&quot;技能原子&quot;；可跳过与自适应讲如何让老玩家和回流玩家不被同一套流程二次折磨。</p>\n<p>第四条线是<strong>实践</strong>：聚焦&quot;怎么验证它有没有用&quot;。留存与漏斗给出 FTUE 漏斗模型和 2026 年的真实留存基准；引导度量定义完成率、到达时间、步级流失这些可instrument 的指标；陷阱与边界收束全 hub，盘点常见反模式，并划清本 hub 与关卡、UI/UX、遥测、叙事的职责边界。</p>\n<p><strong>本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</strong>：引导的难度曲线设计本身属于 <a href=\"../level-design/\">关卡设计</a> 与难度平衡；提示气泡、HUD、菜单的视觉与交互规范属于 <a href=\"../game-ui-ux/\">UI/UX</a>；留存事件的采集管线、漏斗与 A/B 实验框架属于 <a href=\"../game-telemetry-analytics/\">遥测与分析</a>；用剧情和角色承载教学的写作属于 <a href=\"../game-narrative-design/\">叙事设计</a>。本 hub 只负责把这些能力<strong>编排</strong>成一段&quot;让新玩家学会并留下&quot;的体验，遇到它们的内部机制时一律点到为止、链接过去，不重复展开。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径</strong>：设计师从&quot;基础→手段→结构&quot;顺读，建立完整的设计直觉；数据/增长岗可直接从第四章&quot;实践&quot;切入，再回看前三章理解指标背后的设计动因；工程实现岗建议先读&quot;手段&quot;与&quot;结构&quot;，把引导当成一套可配置的状态机来落地。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：阅读本 hub 不需要编程基础，但若你对核心玩法循环、留存/漏斗这两个概念完全陌生，建议先浏览 <a href=\"../game-design/\">游戏设计</a> 的玩法循环部分，再回到这里。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tutorial-onboarding/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-onboarding","title":"为何新手引导","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tutorial-onboarding/foundations/why-onboarding"},{"seq":2,"slug":"learning-curve","title":"学习曲线与心流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tutorial-onboarding/foundations/learning-curve"},{"seq":3,"slug":"teaching-methods-spectrum","title":"教学手段谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tutorial-onboarding/foundations/teaching-methods-spectrum"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"techniques","title":"手段","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tutorial-onboarding/techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"contextual-teaching","title":"情境化教学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tutorial-onboarding/techniques/contextual-teaching"},{"seq":2,"slug":"guided-vs-discovery","title":"引导与发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tutorial-onboarding/techniques/guided-vs-discovery"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tooltips-prompts","title":"提示与遮罩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tutorial-onboarding/techniques/tooltips-prompts"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"structure","title":"结构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tutorial-onboarding/structure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pacing-gating","title":"节奏与解锁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tutorial-onboarding/structure/pacing-gating"},{"seq":2,"slug":"staged-complexity","title":"渐进复杂度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tutorial-onboarding/structure/staged-complexity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"skippable-adaptive","title":"可跳过与自适应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tutorial-onboarding/structure/skippable-adaptive"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tutorial-onboarding/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"retention-funnel","title":"留存与漏斗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tutorial-onboarding/practice/retention-funnel"},{"seq":2,"slug":"onboarding-metrics","title":"引导度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tutorial-onboarding/practice/onboarding-metrics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"onboarding-pitfalls","title":"陷阱与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-tutorial-onboarding/practice/onboarding-pitfalls"}]}]}